  "extra_vbs": "\n' ---- PAD: the Munsters' mechs (munsters_pro.shadow.json)\n' Dragula: the ball rests on sw29 in front of the car, which is a Plunger\n' (CarPlunger); the game's DRAGULA KICKER coil fires it.\nSub PadDragula(e)\n\tIf e Then\n\t\tCarPlunger.Pullback\n\t\tCarPlunger.Fire\n\t\tPlaySoundAt \"fx_plungerpull\", CarPlunger\n\tEnd If\nEnd Sub\n' the up post at the top of the loop (the table's DropStop wall)\nSub PadUpPost(e)\n\tDropStop.Collidable = e\n\tDropStop.IsDropped = Not e\nEnd Sub\n' Spot's trap door: the coil opens it (the table's RaiseSpot: the door\n' shown open, the wall that turns the ball onto Spot's ramp up)\nSub PadSpotDoor(e)\n\tIf e Then\n\t\tRaiseSpot\n\tElse\n\t\tDropSpot\n\tEnd If\nEnd Sub\n' Herman's magnet (the table's cvpmMagnet on HMagnet)\nSub PadMagnet(e)\n\tmHMagnet.MagnetOn = e\nEnd Sub\n",
